<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Alec Benjamin</songwriter><songwriter>Alex Hope</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">她那时19岁 孩子即将出生</text><text for="L2">在城东没日没夜地干活</text><text for="L3">晚上刷碗 她几乎昏昏欲睡</text><text for="L4">她坚信她总有一天会熬出头</text><text for="L5">深夜 她坐着巴士穿过小镇回到她的单间</text><text for="L6">把灯点着后</text><text for="L7">她会坐在桌旁</text><text for="L8">告诉自己一切都很好</text><text for="L9">她期盼着孩子出生的那一刻</text><text for="L10">她永远都不会孑然一身</text><text for="L11">永远都会有一个拥抱在等她</text><text for="L12">长夜漫漫中她说</text><text for="L13">这世界没那么完美 但也没那么糟糕</text><text for="L14">只要有彼此 就是拥有了整个世界</text><text for="L15">我会作为你的母亲 紧紧抓住你的手</text><text for="L16">你要知道我永远会在你身旁</text><text for="L17">当这世界没那么完美时</text><text for="L18">当这世界没那么友好时</text><text for="L19">只要有彼此 就能突破重重难关</text><text for="L20">我会作为你的母亲 紧紧抓住你的手</text><text for="L21">你要知道我永远会在你身旁</text><text for="L22">他们那时90岁 住在城西 与他们订婚的地方毗邻</text><text for="L23">他们的墙上挂满回忆</text><text for="L24">尽管生活并非一帆风顺 他们依旧感恩能与对方相濡以沫</text><text for="L25">而且尽管还有更艰难的时刻</text><text for="L26">甚至她激怒了他 他也从未让她伤心</text><text for="L27">他们没有豪车</text><text for="L28">但他们从不需要远行 因为他们就是彼此的风景</text><text for="L29">直到生命的尽头 他们的爱比他们邂逅时更为坚定</text><text for="L30">他们说</text><text for="L31">这世界没那么完美 但也没那么糟糕</text><text for="L32">只要有彼此 就是拥有了整个世界</text><text for="L33">我会作为你的伴侣 紧紧抓住你的手</text><text for="L34">你要知道我永远会在你身旁</text><text for="L35">当这世界没那么完美时</text><text for="L36">当这世界没那么友好时</text><text for="L37">只要有彼此 就能突破重重难关</text><text for="L38">我会作为你的伴侣 紧紧抓住你的手</text><text for="L39">你要知道我永远会在你身旁</text><text for="L40">你要知道我永远会在你身旁</text><text for="L41">我今年23岁 父母日渐衰老</text><text for="L42">我明白他们不可能永远陪伴我 而我又害怕孤独</text><text for="L43">所以我非常感激我的姐姐 尽管我们有时难免打打闹闹</text><text for="L44">多亏她 我熬过了艰难的高中时光</text><text for="L45">我知道她永远都不会抛弃我</text><text for="L46">而我不愿看到她哭泣</text><text for="L47">因此我写下这句歌词 让她知道我永远在她身旁</text><text for="L48">我写下这句歌词让她知道我永远在她身旁</text><text for="L49">我写下这句歌词让她知道</text><text for="L50">这世界没那么完美 但也没那么糟糕</text><text for="L51">只要有彼此 就是拥有了整个世界</text><text for="L52">我会作为你的弟弟 紧紧抓住你的手</text><text for="L53">你要知道我永远会在你身旁</text><text for="L54">当这世界没那么完美时</text><text for="L55">当这世界没那么友好时</text><text for="L56">只要有彼此 就能突破重重难关</text><text for="L57">我会作为你的弟弟 紧紧抓住你的手</text><text for="L58">你要知道我永远会在你身旁</text><text for="L59">你要知道我永远会在你身旁</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="If We Have Each Other"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Alec Benjamin"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Narrated for You"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1441728724"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USAT21804358"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:00.125" end="2:57.575"><p begin="0:00.125" end="0:03.155" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:00.125" end="0:00.425">She</span> <span begin="0:00.425" end="0:01.265">was</span> <span begin="0:01.265" end="0:01.805">19</span> <span begin="0:01.805" end="0:01.985">with</span> <span begin="0:01.985" end="0:02.045">a</span> <span begin="0:02.045" end="0:02.465">baby</span> <span begin="0:02.465" end="0:02.645">on</span> <span begin="0:02.645" end="0:02.705">the</span> <span begin="0:02.705" end="0:03.155">way</span></p><p begin="0:03.155" end="0:05.765" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:03.155" end="0:03.335">On</span> <span begin="0:03.335" end="0:03.425">the</span> <span begin="0:03.425" end="0:03.665">east-</span><span begin="0:03.695" end="0:03.875">side</span> <span begin="0:03.875" end="0:03.995">of</span> <span begin="0:03.995" end="0:04.085">the</span> <span begin="0:04.085" end="0:04.445">city</span> <span begin="0:04.445" end="0:04.655">she</span> <span begin="0:04.655" end="0:04.835">was</span> <span begin="0:04.835" end="0:05.195">working</span> <span begin="0:05.195" end="0:05.465">every</span> <span begin="0:05.465" end="0:05.765">day</span></p><p begin="0:05.765" end="0:08.555" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:05.765" end="0:06.155">Cleaning</span> <span begin="0:06.155" end="0:06.605">dishes</span> <span begin="0:06.605" end="0:06.755">in</span> <span begin="0:06.755" end="0:06.845">the</span> <span begin="0:06.845" end="0:07.205">evening</span> <span begin="0:07.205" end="0:07.385">she</span> <span begin="0:07.385" end="0:07.565">could</span> <span begin="0:07.565" end="0:07.865">barely</span> <span begin="0:07.865" end="0:08.165">stay</span> <span begin="0:08.165" end="0:08.555">awake</span></p><p begin="0:08.555" end="0:11.495" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:08.555" end="0:08.795">She</span> <span begin="0:08.795" end="0:08.945">was</span> <span begin="0:08.945" end="0:09.305">clinging</span> <span begin="0:09.305" end="0:09.485">to</span> <span begin="0:09.485" end="0:09.605">the</span> <span begin="0:09.605" end="0:10.025">feeling</span> <span begin="0:10.025" end="0:10.265">that</span> <span begin="0:10.265" end="0:10.325">her</span> <span begin="0:10.325" end="0:10.565">luck</span> <span begin="0:10.565" end="0:10.685">was</span> <span begin="0:10.685" end="0:10.985">gonna</span> <span begin="0:10.985" end="0:11.495">change</span></p><p begin="0:11.495" end="0:15.635" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:11.495" end="0:11.735">And,</span> <span begin="0:12.005" end="0:12.455">across</span> <span begin="0:12.455" end="0:12.905">town</span> <span begin="0:12.905" end="0:13.145">she'd</span> <span begin="0:13.145" end="0:13.355">take</span> <span begin="0:13.355" end="0:13.445">the</span> <span begin="0:13.445" end="0:13.715">bus</span> <span begin="0:13.715" end="0:13.805">at</span> <span begin="0:13.805" end="0:14.105">night</span> <span begin="0:14.105" end="0:14.375">to</span> <span begin="0:14.375" end="0:14.405">a</span> <span begin="0:14.405" end="0:14.705">one</span> <span begin="0:14.705" end="0:15.095">bedroom</span> <span begin="0:15.095" end="0:15.635">apartment</span></p><p begin="0:15.635" end="0:16.895" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:15.635" end="0:15.785">And</span> <span begin="0:15.785" end="0:15.875">then</span> <span begin="0:15.875" end="0:16.085">she'd</span> <span begin="0:16.085" end="0:16.295">turn</span> <span begin="0:16.295" end="0:16.445">on</span> <span begin="0:16.445" end="0:16.535">the</span> <span begin="0:16.535" end="0:16.895">light</span></p><p begin="0:16.895" end="0:18.305" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:16.895" end="0:17.105">She</span> <span begin="0:17.105" end="0:17.255">would</span> <span begin="0:17.255" end="0:17.465">sit</span> <span begin="0:17.465" end="0:17.675">down</span> <span begin="0:17.675" end="0:17.825">at</span> <span begin="0:17.825" end="0:17.945">the</span> <span begin="0:17.945" end="0:18.305">table</span></p><p begin="0:18.305" end="0:19.655" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:18.305" end="0:18.545">Tell</span> <span begin="0:18.545" end="0:18.905">herself</span> <span begin="0:18.905" end="0:19.085">that</span> <span begin="0:19.085" end="0:19.265">it's</span> <span begin="0:19.265" end="0:19.655">alright</span></p><p begin="0:19.655" end="0:22.445" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.655" end="0:19.865">She</span> <span begin="0:19.865" end="0:20.045">was</span> <span begin="0:20.045" end="0:20.465">waiting</span> <span begin="0:20.465" end="0:20.645">on</span> <span begin="0:20.645" end="0:20.735">the</span> <span begin="0:20.735" end="0:20.945">day,</span> <span begin="0:20.945" end="0:21.125">she</span> <span begin="0:21.125" end="0:21.365">hoped</span> <span begin="0:21.365" end="0:21.425">her</span> <span begin="0:21.425" end="0:21.785">baby</span> <span begin="0:21.785" end="0:22.055">would</span> <span begin="0:22.055" end="0:22.445">arrive</span></p><p begin="0:22.445" end="0:25.625" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:22.445" end="0:23.105">She'd</span> <span begin="0:23.105" end="0:23.648">ne</span><span begin="0:23.648" end="0:24.155">ver</span> <span begin="0:24.155" end="0:24.755">be</span> <span begin="0:24.755" end="0:25.625">alone</span></p><p begin="0:25.655" end="0:28.475" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:25.655" end="0:26.495">Have</span> <span begin="0:26.495" end="0:27.455">someone</span> <span begin="0:27.455" end="0:27.635">to</span> <span begin="0:27.635" end="0:28.475">hold</span></p><p begin="0:28.685" end="0:32.705" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.685" end="0:29.195">And</span> <span begin="0:29.195" end="0:29.675">when</span> <span begin="0:29.675" end="0:30.275">night's</span> <span begin="0:30.275" end="0:30.395">were</span> <span begin="0:30.395" end="0:31.355">cold</span> <span begin="0:31.355" end="0:31.985">she'd</span> <span begin="0:31.985" end="0:32.705">say</span></p><p begin="0:33.065" end="0:35.735" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:33.065" end="0:33.215">The</span> <span begin="0:33.215" end="0:33.605">world's</span> <span begin="0:33.605" end="0:33.875">not</span> <span begin="0:33.875" end="0:34.295">perfect</span> <span begin="0:34.295" end="0:34.505">but</span> <span begin="0:34.505" end="0:34.655">it's</span> <span begin="0:34.655" end="0:34.955">not</span> <span begin="0:34.955" end="0:35.255">that</span> <span begin="0:35.255" end="0:35.735">bad</span></p><p begin="0:35.735" end="0:38.495" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:35.735" end="0:35.885">If</span> <span begin="0:35.885" end="0:36.005">we</span> <span begin="0:36.005" end="0:36.395">got</span> <span begin="0:36.395" end="0:36.785">each</span> <span begin="0:36.785" end="0:37.085">other</span> <span begin="0:37.085" end="0:37.265">and</span> <span begin="0:37.265" end="0:37.475">that's</span> <span begin="0:37.475" end="0:37.745">all</span> <span begin="0:37.745" end="0:37.985">we</span> <span begin="0:37.985" end="0:38.495">have</span></p><p begin="0:38.495" end="0:41.375" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:38.495" end="0:38.645">I</span> <span begin="0:38.645" end="0:38.765">will</span> <span begin="0:38.765" end="0:39.125">be</span> <span begin="0:39.125" end="0:39.365">your</span> <span begin="0:39.365" end="0:39.845">mother</span> <span begin="0:39.845" end="0:40.175">and</span> <span begin="0:40.175" end="0:40.535">hold</span> <span begin="0:40.535" end="0:40.775">your</span> <span begin="0:40.775" end="0:41.375">hand</span></p><p begin="0:41.675" end="0:44.045" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:41.675" end="0:41.945">You</span> <span begin="0:41.945" end="0:42.215">should</span> <span begin="0:42.215" end="0:42.515">know</span> <span begin="0:42.515" end="0:42.755">I'll</span> <span begin="0:42.755" end="0:42.935">be</span> <span begin="0:42.935" end="0:43.415">there</span> <span begin="0:43.415" end="0:43.565">for</span> <span begin="0:43.565" end="0:44.045">you</span></p><p begin="0:44.045" end="0:45.395" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:44.045" end="0:44.195">And</span> <span begin="0:44.195" end="0:44.285">the</span> <span begin="0:44.285" end="0:44.675">world's</span> <span begin="0:44.675" end="0:44.945">not</span> <span begin="0:44.945" end="0:45.395">perfect</span></p><p begin="0:45.395" end="0:46.805" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:45.395" end="0:45.605">When</span> <span begin="0:45.605" end="0:45.695">the</span> <span begin="0:45.695" end="0:46.085">world's</span> <span begin="0:46.085" end="0:46.325">not</span> <span begin="0:46.325" end="0:46.805">kind</span></p><p begin="0:46.805" end="0:49.595" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:46.805" end="0:46.955">If</span> <span begin="0:46.955" end="0:47.105">we</span> <span begin="0:47.105" end="0:47.495">have</spa